	<string id="pf_ne_route_help_points_title"><text>POINTS AND 3D PLACEMENT</text></string>
	<string id="pf_ne_route_help_points_body"><text>First select or create a [DEV] NPC.\n\n“Add in 3D” creates the next point. Point 1 also becomes the NPC starting position.\n\nIn 3D: 1/2 — camera, 3–6 — mode, wheel — rotate, Q/R — animation, ESC — cancel.</text></string>
	<string id="pf_ne_route_help_wait_title"><text>WAIT AND ANIMATION</text></string>
	<string id="pf_ne_route_help_wait_body"><text>[T] — stable pose: uses time in seconds.\n\n[A] — one-shot animation: “Until animation ends” may be enabled and time is ignored.\n\nThe checkbox is disabled when completion cannot be detected reliably.</text></string>
	<string id="pf_ne_route_help_order_title"><text>ORDER, LOOP AND SHUFFLE</text></string>
	<string id="pf_ne_route_help_order_body"><text>“Up” and “Down” change order. Point 1 always remains the route start.\n\nShuffle keeps point 1 first, then visits points 2…N once each without repeats.\n\nLoop starts a new pass after the final point.</text></string>
	<string id="pf_ne_route_help_runtime_title"><text>SAVES AND ERRORS</text></string>
	<string id="pf_ne_route_help_runtime_body"><text>Editing pauses the route. Use the separate Start button to run it.\n\nOFFLINE does not delete the route: the NPC resumes its current target when ONLINE.\n\nRoutes require the AI mesh and never teleport an NPC to hide a path failure.\n\n“Write route log” creates a separate portable LTX.</text></string>
